   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2024-03-21",
   "text": "Stop Subsidizing Giant Mergers Act \nThis bill eliminates the deferral of tax for shareholders who receive stock through corporate mergers, acquisitions, or transfers involving corporations with annual gross receipts exceeding $500 million over the three preceding taxable year period."
